%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: a4fafe43b89343e3a7ba1235e8987c0f, type: 3}
  m_Name: Epilogue3_0_Driving
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  Entries:
  - content: "<i>*yawn*</i> How much longer till we get to the campsite? Feels like
      we\u2019ve been stopping and starting a lot."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e9d3865c367188f4f99c47e692b92911, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 314095995325513790
    - rid: 314095995325513793
    - rid: 314095995325513791
    - rid: 314095995325513792
    - rid: 314095995325513798
  - content: Sorry! Somehow I think we missed a turn somewhere?
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 275918e912c757f4ab1b228eefee6401, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 314095995325513794
    - rid: 314095995325513795
    - rid: 314095995325513797
    - rid: 314095995325513799
  - content: So much for being a great navigator, Cam.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e9d3865c367188f4f99c47e692b92911, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 314095995325513800
    - rid: 314095995325513801
  - content: "I am, typically! But something\u2019s strange. See this mountain peak
      on the map? If we look in that direction, it doesn\u2019t exist!"
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 275918e912c757f4ab1b228eefee6401, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 314095995325513802
    - rid: 314095995325513803
  - content: "I also don\u2019t know how to explain this... But we\u2019re supposed
      to be passing a river right about now."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 275918e912c757f4ab1b228eefee6401, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: "Ives, you don\u2019t suppose maybe the mapmaker was mistaken?"
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e9d3865c367188f4f99c47e692b92911, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 314095995325513804
    - rid: 314095995325513805
  - content: I doubt it, this map was recorded by Master Scout Jay himself on the
      first expedition out here. He knows best when it comes to picking good landmarks.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5e611c80cca3abf42b4a5c1a2294b953, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 314095995325513807
    - rid: 314095995325513808
    - rid: 314095995325513809
    - rid: 314095995325513810
  - content: Then perhaps something altered the geography, the meteorite maybe...?
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e9d3865c367188f4f99c47e692b92911, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 314095995325513811
    - rid: 314095995325513812
  - content: Could be.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5e611c80cca3abf42b4a5c1a2294b953, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 314095995325513813
    - rid: 314095995325513814
  - content: Oh right the meteorite! Maybe I can try using its resonance readings
      to triangulate our position instead.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 275918e912c757f4ab1b228eefee6401, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 314095995325513815
    - rid: 7570221391745384510
  - content: "Good thinkin\u2019. Once we get there, we\u2019ll need to focus on
      setting up camp fast. We only have a good couple hours before it gets dark
      out here."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5e611c80cca3abf42b4a5c1a2294b953, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 314095995325513816
  - content: <i>Eventually, the convoy comes to a halt.  A lingering sense of unease
      permeating through the tang of gasoline as the soldiers fan out to pitch camp.</i>
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9eb64e5cd0fdbe944b654af85100bcb6, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 314095995325513817
  - content: 
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4fef3aeb65460fd498ab9efe9bac8625, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 314095995325513818
    - rid: 314095995325513819
    - rid: 314095995325513820
